      "widgets_values": [
        "## Utility passes from a plate\n\nThe plate never went through 3D and comp still gets a Z and an N.\n\nThree passes off one photographic still, no render layers:\n\n- **depth** - Depth Anything 3, `depth_anything_3_mono_large.safetensors`\n- **normal_opengl** - MoGe-2, `moge-2-vitl-normal.pt`\n- **alpha** - SAM3 detect on a text prompt, joined onto the plate as its alpha\n\nModels live in `ComfyUI/models/geometry_estimation/` and `ComfyUI/models/checkpoints/`.\n"
